{'symbol': 'CMS', 'date': '2023-05-15 09:00:00', 'title': 'CMS ENERGY ANNOUNCES RALPH IZZO TO JOIN BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'JACKSON, MICH. , MAY 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- RALPH IZZO, RETIRED CHAIRMAN, PRESIDENT AND CEO OF PUBLIC SERVICE ENTERPRISE GROUP (PSEG), HAS BEEN ELECTED TO THE CMS ENERGY AND CONSUMERS ENERGY BOARDS OF DIRECTORS EFFECTIVE MAY 15, 2023.'}